set)\n- [Shaka Lion's Set](/episodes/all-day-2019/#shaka-lions-set)\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":29100,"location":"US","published_at":"2019-01-01T16:21:36+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Second Set","position":3}},{"id":"c0SPviorSCc","position":1,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Cortex - 8-Oct-71 (Huit Octobre 71)","track":{"id":"rwgRZEitl7I","path":"/artists/cortex/tracks/8-oct-71-huit-octobre-71/","slug":"8-oct-71-huit-octobre-71","title":"8-Oct-71 (Huit Octobre 71)","artist":{"slug":"cortex","title":"Cortex"},"artwork":"images/artists/cortex/tracks/8-oct-71-huit-octobre-71.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"uvJZqSGqvgU","slug":"boilerroom-streaming-from-isolation-14","tags":[6,3],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/joekay/jboiler-room-streaming-from-isolation-14"},"state":"published","title":"Boilerroom - Joe Kay 4 hour Streaming from Isolation #14","artwork":null,"content":"Joe Kay appears on BoilerRoom Live Streaming from Isolation sessions.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\n[Please support here if you can.](https://business.facebook.com/donate/219168332618496/)\n\nDuring the pandemic, tune into our new live series Streaming From Isolation. These broadcasts will stream from artists’ homes and private spaces, direct to our audience and without the need for interaction with production teams - as we practice social distancing to remove risk from our programming.\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-04-10T20:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's 4 hour experiance","position":0}},{"id":"7CZrX7L8ykE","position":84,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Cortex - 8 Oct 71","track":{"id":"bLfpH4RniEU","path":"/artists/cortex/tracks/8-oct-71/","slug":"8-oct-71","title":"8 Oct 71","artist":{"slug":"cortex","title":"Cortex"},"artwork":"images/artists/cortex/tracks/8-oct-71.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"KGbt4wCudfQ","slug":"168","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-168-sxsw"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #168 (SXSW Pre Show)","artwork":"/images/episodes/168.jpg","content":"Joe kay getting you ready for SXSW.\n<!--more-->\n\nAs we are getting ready for SXSW we wanted to get you in the spirit. Joe Kay went solo again to keep things simple and focused. He kicked it off with the new Carmack/Esta collab, played some new discoveries/unreleased gems, and then switched up the whole format by letting the live listener selects the music by sending us our requests via our social media networks. What a beautiful thing! For over 2 hours, you had the chance to selects the music, Joe was just the provider! What a great way to collaborate right? Since we will be at SXSW from (March 11-16) there won't be a live Soulection Radio show next week, however, we do have a special guest mix to make up for it. Stay tuned.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10818,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-03-08T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"Kr2TfoZZYko","position":32,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Cortex - 8-Oct-71 (Huit Octobre 71)","track":{"id":"rwgRZEitl7I","path":"/artists/cortex/tracks/8-oct-71-huit-octobre-71/","slug":"8-oct-71-huit-octobre-71","title":"8-Oct-71 (Huit Octobre 71)","artist":{"slug":"cortex","title":"Cortex"},"artwork":"images/artists/cortex/tracks/8-oct-71-huit-octobre-71.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"dmevNeYyuRE","slug":"179","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-179"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #179","artwork":"/images/episodes/179.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10740,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-07-12T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"N7nyA6Ouokg","position"